  * Performs geocoding using the `Geocoding.geocode` method provided by the Geocoding add-on.
  * Stores the latitude and longitude in corresponding columns using `appendRow`.

Replace `sheet` with the name of the sheet containing the place names.

6. Save the script and run it by going to Run > myFunction. This will execute the function and store the latitude and longitude in the specified columns.

